Z||000010||GTDusty||09-17-2001||12:42 AM|||| Here's the deal.. if you can get it for under $1000 definately jump on it. Typical going price for a DeLorean with no major damage running or not is around the $10,000 neighborhood. The cars are extremely rare so getting your hands on one is a mjor accomplishment. As for the engine, if you can have it repaired the resale will be alot higher than if you converted it. My advise is to leave it stock-ish and fix it.<P>Dusty||||reg||10
